  "3430|0e16a4d2": {
   "build": "70245",
   "class": "Druid",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1413,
   "name": "Mangletooth",
   "npc": "3430",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Windshaper Skyborne",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "You! $R! Come here. <snort>\n\nTime is short, and my end <snort> is near. Mangletooth shall win; you will see. <snort>\n\nMy capture can still aid <snort> my people. The Razormane tribe is more powerful than the Bristlebacks!\n\nThe Horde looks to find out who leads the raids on their people. You <snort> shall aid Mangletooth in return for the information only I know. Mangletooth can help you! <snort> But you must help Mangletooth.",
   "time": 1791382731,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "The Barrens"
  },
  "3430|71e13f0e": {
   "build": "70245",
   "class": "Druid",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1413,
   "name": "Mangletooth",
   "npc": "3430",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Windshaper Skyborne",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "My hatred is strong <snort>, but the time is right to tell you a tale, $r.\n\nLong ago a battle took place between gods. Agamaggan, our great boar god, fell to the earth after being defeated in the War of the Ancients, his blood raining down and his bones torn asunder. <snort>\n\nGreat thorns reached up out of the earth where his blood touched the ground, and his skull adorns one of the caverns to the south.",
   "time": 1791382736,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "The Barrens"
  },
  "3432|c1a3099b": {
   "build": "70245",
   "class": "Druid",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1413,
   "name": "Mankrik",
   "npc": "3432",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Windshaper Skyborne",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "I came to the Crossroads from the south seeking help, $c, but I find only cowards who turn their backs on me--even the mighty Thork insults me so. He is a good leader, but his dismissal of my plea causes me greater anger.\n\nHe claims my rage makes me hasty--that it clouds my judgement--but I will not rest until I have vengeance!",
   "time": 1791381088,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "The Barrens"
  },
  "3433|4ec00f6f": {
   "build": "70245",
   "class": "Druid",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1413,
   "name": "Tatternack Steelforge",
   "npc": "3433",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Windshaper Skyborne",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "The Warchief has instructed me to study all kinds of weapons and armor. He has sent me here to the hub of both the tauren and orc cultures in the Barrens to meet as many travelers as possible, and to learn about the cultures of the Barrens.\n\nHe feels there's something to be learned from even the most pathetic of cultures... like the quilboar or centaur.",
   "time": 1791368441,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "The Barrens"
  },
  "3448|dcea3712": {
   "build": "70245",
   "class": "Druid",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1413,
   "name": "Tonga Runetotem",
   "npc": "3448",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Windshaper Skyborne",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "The times we live in are as fickle as the shifting winds, $c.  It is important to remember what is true and lasting in this world, and to preserve that.  Everything else is a waste.",
   "time": 1791381109,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "The Barrens"
  },
