   "name": "Grunt Logmar",
   "npc": "5911",
   "questID": 97250,
   "race": "Windshaper Skyborne",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Traveler, have you plans to head toward Dustwallow Marsh? I have heard mutterings that a few human soldiers have taken a stand at its border and are toppling the landmarks left behind by our tauren pathfinders.\r\n\r\nRumor has it that a favored tavern has burned to the ground, and in typical Alliance fashion, they immediately cast their blame onto the Horde! I cannot know whether there is any truth to their claim, but their incursion onto OUR land must not stand.\r\n\r\nKill first, investigate later!",
   "time": 1791368416,
   "title": "Wrongly Blamed, Justly Corrected",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "The Barrens"
  }
